bin/
run/
*.jsonl
runs/

# Python's bytecode, left beside the test helpers that uv runs.
__pycache__/

# The test fixtures are rows too, and the *.jsonl rule above would swallow them.
# They are a handful of lines written by hand, with the figures they summarise to
# worked out on paper beside them, so they belong in the repository.
!internal/bench/testdata/**

# Sweep output is ignored above because a full pass is hundreds of megabytes
# across ~220 cells. Reference measurements cited by the README are different in
# kind and are kept, so every published figure stays recomputable from the rows
# it came from rather than being an assertion.
!docs/measurements/**
# Local editor and OS clutter, and the binary `go build ./cmd/preflight` leaves at the root.
# Anchored, so it cannot swallow cmd/preflight/.
.DS_Store
.vscode
/preflight
